---
title: Irrigation Inspection — Runtime Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dispatcher
    actor Tech
    participant FSM as Salesforce FSM
    participant LWC as Inspection LWC
    participant Map as Mapbox Map LWC
    participant Resolver as Question Set Resolver
    participant QL as Question Library
    participant Stage as Asset Change Staging
    participant Suggest as Suggested Repair Engine
    participant Flow as Checkout/Completion Flows
    participant AM as Account Manager
    participant EW as ExtraWork

    Dispatcher->>FSM: Schedule Service Appointment
    Tech->>LWC: Check in to appointment
    LWC->>FSM: Capture GPS and set In Progress
    LWC->>Map: Load Map_Feature__c for property context
    Map-->>LWC: Render points/polygons/lines

    LWC->>Resolver: Resolve set(region + season/type + work type)
    Resolver->>QL: Query published sets
    alt Exactly one match
        QL-->>Resolver: Set Id + Version
        Resolver-->>LWC: Resolved set
        LWC->>FSM: Snapshot Resolved_Question_Set + Version on SA
    else No match
        Resolver-->>LWC: No match
        LWC-->>Tech: Fail loudly with admin next steps
    end

    LWC->>FSM: Check required asset types for selected set
    alt Missing required assets
        LWC-->>Tech: Enter bootstrap mode
        Tech->>LWC: Create/edit minimum assets for this scope
        LWC->>Stage: Stage field-level before/after changes
        Stage-->>LWC: Pending asset change records
    else Assets present
        LWC-->>Tech: Continue inspection
    end

    loop During form completion
        Tech->>LWC: Answer question
        LWC->>FSM: Upsert Inspection_Response__c
        LWC->>Suggest: Evaluate failed-value rules
        Suggest->>FSM: Upsert deduped suggestion (Inspection + Asset + IssueType)
        opt Tech captures ad hoc map feature
            Tech->>Map: Add pin/line/polygon
            Map->>FSM: Upsert Map_Feature__c (queue if offline)
        end
    end

    Tech->>LWC: Start checkout
    LWC->>FSM: Validate required questions answered
    alt Missing required answers
        LWC-->>Tech: Block checkout and highlight gaps
    else Complete
        LWC->>FSM: Load suggested repairs
        Tech->>LWC: Confirm/edit/dismiss suggestions
        LWC->>FSM: Create pending WOLIs for confirmed items
        Note over LWC,FSM: Severity + structured description + Callout_Type (Repair/Enhancement) required; AM required
        Tech->>LWC: Submit inspection
        LWC->>Flow: Trigger completion automations

        Flow->>Stage: Apply staged asset changes
        alt Apply successful
            Stage-->>Flow: Success
        else Apply failure
            Stage-->>Flow: Failure detail
            Flow->>FSM: Create asset sync exception
            Note over Flow,FSM: Keep inspection completed
        end

        Flow->>FSM: Generate internal and customer PDFs
        Flow->>FSM: Stamp completion tracking fields
    end

    AM->>FSM: Review pending WOLIs
    alt Quote needed
        AM->>EW: Build ExtraWork estimate
        EW-->>FSM: Save estimate line reference
    else In-contract repair
        AM->>FSM: Route to repair scheduling
    end
